        "## 4. Drut",
        "",
        "This section features a fast-tempo passage in Teentaal, bringing heightened energy and rhythmic drive.",
        "",
        "It emphasizes brisk melodic movements and precise rhythmic alignment while retaining the raga’s essence."
      ]
